                            aria-labelledby="heading2"
                            data-bs-parent="#faqaccordion">

                            <div class="accordion-body">

                                <p>
                                    Yes. We provide professional washing machine
                                    servicing, maintenance and repair for common
                                    appliance issues. Our technicians inspect the
                                    appliance and recommend the appropriate
