                                </p>

                            </div>

                        </div>

                    </div>
                    <!-- FAQ Item End -->


                    <!-- FAQ Item Start -->
                    <div class="accordion-item wow fadeInUp"
                        data-wow-delay="0.4s">

                        <h2 class="accordion-header" id="heading3">

                            <button class="accordion-button collapsed"
                                type="button"
                                data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                data-bs-target="#collapse3"
                                aria-expanded="false"
                                aria-controls="collapse3">

                                How often should I service my AC?

                            </button>

                        </h2>


                        <div id="collapse3"
                            class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                            aria-labelledby="heading3"
                            data-bs-parent="#faqaccordion">

                            <div class="accordion-body">

                                <p>
                                    Regular AC maintenance helps maintain cooling
                                    performance and airflow. The ideal service
                                    frequency depends on usage, environment and
                                    the condition of your AC.
                                </p>

                            </div>

                        </div>

                    </div>
                    <!-- FAQ Item End -->


                    <!-- FAQ Item Start -->
                    <div class="accordion-item wow fadeInUp"
                        data-wow-delay="0.6s">

                        <h2 class="accordion-header" id="heading4">

                            <button class="accordion-button collapsed"
                                type="button"
                                data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                data-bs-target="#collapse4"
                                aria-expanded="false"
                                aria-controls="collapse4">

                                How can I book a service with MetroCool?

                            </button>

                        </h2>


                        <div id="collapse4"
                            class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                            aria-labelledby="heading4"
                            data-bs-parent="#faqaccordion">

                            <div class="accordion-body">

                                <p>
                                    You can contact MetroCool directly to discuss
                                    your AC or washing machine issue and schedule
